y syujet bilan uyg‘unlashtiriladi. Tarixiy muhit, sirli voqealar va keskin qarama-qarshiliklarga boy roman Sharq tarixining murakkab davrlaridan birini badiiy nigoh orqali tasvirlaydi.","ru":"«Ассасин» — историко-художественное произведение Махмуда Амина, посвящённое ассасинам (хашшашинам) и событиям средневекового Востока. В романе деятельность тайной организации переплетается с политической борьбой, заговорами и противостоянием за власть. Историческая атмосфера, тайны и напряжённое развитие событий позволяют читателю погрузиться в один из наиболее загадочных периодов истории Востока.","en":"Assassin is a historical novel by Mahmud Amin centered on the Assassins (Hashshashins) and the political turmoil of the medieval East. The story combines the activities of a secretive organization with political rivalries, conspiracies, and struggles for power. Rich in historical atmosphere, mystery, and conflict, the novel offers a fictionalized look at one of the most intriguing chapters of medieval Eastern history."},"ebook":{"access":"public"},"_id":"6a77009322d8389d632faee6","slug":"assasin","price":72000,"discountPrice":0,"image":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dd9xb0bqw/image/upload/v1786183825/bookstore/products/1786183824203-ChatGPT_Image_Aug_8__2026__03_10_03_PM.jpg","stock":29,"barcode":"9789910874581","year":2026,"cover":"hardcover","numberOfPage":306,"category":{"_id":"69fc6b8d025ac962dbb53665","title":{"uz":"Diniy adabiyotlar","ru":"Diniy adabiyotlar","en":"Diniy adabiyotlar"},"subgenres":[{"slug":"siyrat","title":{"uz":"Siyrat","ru":"Siyrat","en":"Siyrat"},"books":["6a71977ee7e78f918da37586","6a71be84e7e78f918da5a057","6aaea9bb86d93835902ce220","6aaeb5d186d93835902d742d"],"order":0,"isActive":true,"_id":"6a674d3ea4282d40e8b31080"},{"slug":"hadis","title":{"uz":"Hadis","ru":"Hadis","en":"Hadis"},"books":["6a71c813e7e78f918da5fd5b","6a7457ce22d8389d6318b478","6aaea9bb86d93835902ce220","6aaeb5d186d93835902d742d","6a55eaad4a50522e829822e4"],"order":1,"isActive":true,"_id