dan-da yoqimliroq lazzat topilmasligini anglashardi. Sarosimali damda o'zlari ham yaxshi tushunmagan gaplarini aytishlari hamono boshlariga qora qopqich kiydirilar, mazkur chora ularga qo'llanilayotgan bo'lsa-da, aslida atrofdagilar jon berayotgan odamni kuzatib qiynalmasligi uchun shunday qilinardi.","ru":"За годы своей службы в тюрьме я стал свидетелем семидесяти восьми казней. Думаю, что не смогу забыть ни одну из них до конца своих дней. Мне всегда казалось, что настоящий страх осуждённые испытывали именно в тот момент, когда их руки и ноги крепко привязывали к электрическому стулу.\r\n\r\nВ их глазах отражался ужас смерти, ноги переставали повиноваться, всё тело цепенело, и казалось, что даже кровь в их жилах застывала. Именно в эти мгновения они осознавали, насколько драгоценна жизнь и что в мире нет ничего более ценного и прекрасного.\r\n\r\nВ состоянии отчаяния они произносили слова, смысл которых порой и сами не до конца понимали. Почти сразу после этого им на голову надевали чёрный колпак. Хотя эта мера применялась по отношению к приговорённым, на самом деле она была нужна для того, чтобы окружающим не приходилось видеть последние мгновения умирающего человека.","en":"During my years working in the prison, I witnessed seventy-eight executions. I doubt I will ever forget any of them for as long as I live. It always seemed to me that the prisoners experienced true fear only when their hands and feet were firmly strapped to the electric chair.\r\n\r\nThe terror of death was reflected in their eyes. Their legs became motionless, their bodies turned numb, and it seemed as though even the blood flowing through their veins had frozen. In that very moment, they realized how precious life truly was and that nothing in this world could be more valuable or more beautiful.\r\n\r\nIn their panic, they uttered words that they themselves scarcely understood. Moments later, a black hood was placed over their heads. Although this measure was imposed on the condemned, its real purpose was to spare those present from witnessing the final moments of a person as they died."},"ebook":{"access":"public"},"_id":"6a55ea6e4a50522e8298077e","author":[{"bio":{"uz":"","ru":"","en":""},"_id":"69fc8932584037138230f1a9","slug":"stiven-king","birthDate":null,"books":["69fc526a584037138230c809","69fc526a584037138230c80c","69fc526a584037138230c80d","69fc526a584037138230c80e","69fc526a584037138230c80f","69fc526a584037138230c812","69fc526a584037138230c813","69fc526a584037138230c814","69fc526d584037138230ceee","69fc526d584037138230ceef","69fc526d584037138230cef0","69fc526d584037138230cef2","69fc526d584037138230cef3","69fc526d584037138230cef4","69fc526d584037138230cef5","69fc526d584037138230cef6","69fc526d584037138230cef7","69fc526d584037138230cef8","69fc526d584037138230cef9","69fc526d584037138230cefa","69fc526d584037138230cefb","69fc5273584037138230dc63","69fc54d4584037138230e1fb","6a55ea6e4a50522e8298077e","6a9feb1f70aacb5675caa6a8"],"createdAt":"2026-05-07T12:44:35.184Z","deathDate":null,"image":"","name":"Stiven King","updatedAt":"2026-09-08T11:01:52.107Z"}],"barcode":"978-9910-601-83-5","branchStocks":[{"storeId":"14363808-eeb9-11ee-0a80-0e6b0024f833","storeName":"0 Book.uz sklad","quantity":11,"reserve":0,"available":11,"syncedAt":"2026-09-21T04:55:25.945Z","_id":"6ab0d70149cfbe2ade7736ac","id":"6ab0d70149cfbe2ade7736ac"},{"storeId":"8cac779b-ab52-11ec-0a80-09ec0007a15e","storeName":"1 Toshkent - Qatortol - bosh do'kon","quantity":19,"reserve":0,"available":19,"syncedAt":"2026-09-21T04:55:25.945Z","_id":"6ab0d70149cfbe2ade7736ad","id":"6ab0d70149cfbe2ade7736ad"},{"storeId":"9a503767-453b-11f0-0a80-0f9d0033e459","storeName":"2 Toshkent - Chorsu filial","quantity":5,"reserve":0,"available":5,"syncedAt":"2026-09-21T04:55:25.945Z","_id":"6ab0d70149cfbe2ade7736ae","id":"6ab0d70149cfbe2ade7736ae"},{"storeId":"257a3813-2da2-11f1-0a80-074c0007a4cf","storeName":"3 Toshkent - Qoraqamish","quantity":9,"reserve":0,"available":9,"syncedAt":"2026-09-21T04:55:25.9